title: "asr-eval-toolkit: ASR Scoring and Annotation QA Toolkit"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-12
url: "https://github.com/veyhthan/asr-eval-toolkit"
license: MIT
description: |
  A minimal, transparent toolkit for scoring automatic speech recognition (ASR)
  output and auditing annotation quality. Computes WER and CER via edit distance,
  detects filler tags, and outputs markdown reports. Python standard library only,
  runs on Python 3.8+.
keywords:
  - ASR
  - speech recognition
  - WER
  - CER
  - evaluation
  - annotation QA
  - transcription
  - natural language processing
  - speech
  - research tools
repository-code: "https://github.com/veyhthan/asr-eval-toolkit"
type: software
